        "purpose": "Durable full-geometry walk owner with map path, session UUID, RECORDING/FINISHING/FINISHED phase, revision and optional point owner/stage/layer/tool; preserves legacy part WKT, insertion target and user-controlled gps_paused. GPS loss and sticky recovery never infer a new pause; the next usable fix continues automatically. Every manual command is locked until point Save/Cancel. Finish acknowledges the final snapshot; successful feature Save or explicit Discard clears it.\n REL-03 adds walk_checkpoint_owner/sequence/root: acknowledged full WKT plus an ordered private delta tail in the owning map; owner defaults to existing UUID, sequence0 for old drafts. GPS producer admits a constant-sized fsynced edit, worker commits full geometry, Finish awaits its barrier; RAM-pending failures remain explicitly unacknowledged.",
